---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    background: '#f4f8ff'
    primaryColor: '#edf4ff'
    primaryBorderColor: '#b4cbea'
    primaryTextColor: '#142945'
    lineColor: '#2864b9'
    edgeLabelBackground: '#f4f8ff'
    fontFamily: "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif"
  themeCSS: |
    .node rect { rx: 17px; ry: 17px; stroke-width: 1.4px; }
    .node.decision rect { fill: #dcecff; stroke: #709fdf; stroke-width: 1.7px; }
    .node.model rect { fill: #e6efff; stroke: #88ace1; stroke-width: 1.7px; }
    .edgeLabel { color: #385573; font-size: 14px; }
    .flowchart-link { stroke-width: 2.7px; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  flowchart:
    htmlLabels: false
---
flowchart TD
    accTitle: Lorca model decisions, tool authorization, and context management
    accDescr: The Rust runtime prepares a request for the local model. The model can use a tool, recall original records, ask the user, or finish. Tool results and recalled records update working context. The harness checkpoints under context pressure before returning to the model.

    decision["Model decision"]
    decision -->|Tool call| registry["Tool registry and discovery"]
    decision -->|Recall old information| search["Search historical archive"]
    decision -->|Ask user| pause["Pause for response"]
    decision -->|Finish| answer["Return model's final answer"]

    registry --> authorization["Rust authorization gateway"] --> permitted["Permitted?"]
    permitted -->|Yes| execute["Execute tool"]
    permitted -->|Approval needed| approve["Ask user"]
    permitted -->|Denied| deny["Return denial or stop"]
    approve -->|Approved| execute
    execute --> observation["Capture real observation"] --> history["Persist full history"]
    history --> working["Update active working<br/>context"]
    search --> records["Return relevant original<br/>records"] --> working

    request["User request"] --> runtime["Lorca Rust runtime"] --> profiler["Hardware and model profiler"]
    profiler --> backend["Configure or reuse inference<br/>backend"] --> manager["Context and memory<br/>manager"]
    observation ~~~ request
    manager --> model["Primary local LLM"]
    working --> pressure["Context pressure?"]
    pressure -->|Yes| checkpoint["Create stable checkpoint"] --> model
    pressure -->|No| model
    model --> decision
    answer -.-> evaluator["Future: optional evaluator<br/>LLM"]

    class decision,permitted,pressure decision;
    class model model;
